% ============================================================================
% rock-type-formation-component.query — worked recall queries against
% rock-type-formation-component.adj (adj-facts-stdlib, GEOLOGY).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall (multiple answers) with citation, backward
% recall (bind a component, find the rock type), and honest abstention on
% igneous (this table only grounds the two rock types whose cited span
% lists more than one forming material).
% ============================================================================

import "rock-type-formation-component.adj"

% Forward: what components does the cited USGS sentence list for metamorphic rock?
? rock_type_formation_component(metamorphic, $Component)

% Backward: which rock type forms from hot mineral-rich fluids?
? rock_type_formation_component($Rock, hot_mineral_rich_fluids)

% Honest abstention: igneous's cited span names only one material, no listed alternatives.
? rock_type_formation_component(igneous, $ComponentIgneous)
